{"ID":"20251009111152-26uqqgj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251009111152-26uqqgj","title":"UPL7-3——碰撞层矩阵","type":"doc","updated":"20251031143930"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111152-apxvtdh","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251009111152-apxvtdh","updated":"20251009111421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251009111233-ah40foi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251009111233-ah40foi","updated":"20251009111421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理检测中的广义阶段和狭义阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251009111334-5gzrnxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111334-5gzrnxe","updated":"20251009111421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体概念详见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250902195926-0tkhu1p","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL2-9——Physics 模块"}]},{"ID":"20251009111237-vjr2pb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111237-vjr2pb2","updated":"20251009111251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在物理引擎中，碰撞简称一般分两步："}]},{"ID":"20251009111251-9qyiddf","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111251-9qyiddf","updated":"20251009111326"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111251-uae8nuf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111251-uae8nuf","updated":"20251009111315"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111251-v3eviw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111251-v3eviw2","updated":"20251009111315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Broadphase（广义阶段 | 粗检测阶段 | 宽阶段检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251009111308-fwbmfti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111308-fwbmfti","updated":"20251009111308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目标：快速找出可能会相撞的一对对象\n方法：用简单的边界盒（AABB：Axis-Aligned Bounding Box，轴对齐包围盒）进行检测\n特点：非常快，但不精确。它不会算真的撞没撞，只负责筛选出候选对"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111251-zylf2tp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111251-zylf2tp","updated":"20251009111326"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111251-0s0clhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111251-0s0clhi","updated":"20251009111326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Narrowphase（狭义阶段 | 精检测阶段 | 窄阶段检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251009111310-w6yn680","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111310-w6yn680","updated":"20251009111310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目标：对 Broadphase 找到的候选对象，进行更精确的检测\n方法：用实际碰撞体形状（球体、胶囊体、多边形、网格等）计算真正的接触点\n特点：精确但耗时大"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111248-pluvvlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111248-pluvvlj","updated":"20251009111248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此在进行碰撞检测时，Broadphase 就像安检口的初筛，它是第一步会做的事情"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111245-dinmysr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251009111245-dinmysr","updated":"20251009111529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优化物理引擎消耗的主要思路"}]},{"ID":"20251009111451-m43wyr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111451-m43wyr2","updated":"20251009111501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理引擎的 CPU 消耗，本质上就是碰撞检测和物理解算的计算量\nUnity 的物理模块会对所有可能发生碰撞的对象进行检测，而这一步就是开销最大的部分之一"}]},{"ID":"20251009111504-ie85vmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111504-ie85vmh","updated":"20251009111506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此优化物理引擎消耗的主要思路，就是从本质上减少物理相关的无效计算"}]},{"ID":"20251009111510-tr34ny4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111510-tr34ny4","updated":"20251009111510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如我们上节课学习的 增加物理更新时间步长 就是减少物理计算的一种方案\n但是在采用这种方案时，一定要注意不能影响我们的物理表现"}]},{"ID":"20251009111512-3miuaoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111512-3miuaoa","updated":"20251009111527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而设置碰撞层矩阵，就是 Unity 提供给我们的避免无效计算的有效解决方案"}]},{"ID":"20251009111529-oo9o1zq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251009111529-oo9o1zq","updated":"20251031143930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Layer Collision Matrix（碰撞层矩阵）设置"}]},{"ID":"20251009111539-fcoaflq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111539-fcoaflq","updated":"20251009111620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Layer Collision Matrix（碰撞层矩阵）设置，可以在 Unity 的 Project Settings 中的 Physics 相关页签中找到"}]},{"ID":"20251009111551-k92nfzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111551-k92nfzn","updated":"20251031143930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251009111702-ab0cpvc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251009111539-r3rzp9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111539-r3rzp9j","updated":"20251009111709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Unity 的物理系统中，每个碰撞器都属于某一个 Layer（层级）\nLayer Collision Matrix（层碰撞矩阵） 就是一张 Layer 与 Layer 之间是否参与碰撞检测的开关表"}]},{"ID":"20251009111712-y3asr0z","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111712-y3asr0z","updated":"20251009111722"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111714-u892nxn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111714-u892nxn","updated":"20251009111714"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111714-cmjjhlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111714-cmjjhlp","updated":"20251009111714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"勾选，则两个层中的碰撞器会进行碰撞检测"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111714-3p2oyzz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111714-3p2oyzz","updated":"20251009111722"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111714-7besblj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111714-7besblj","updated":"20251009111722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取消勾选，则两个层中的碰撞器完全不会进入Broadphase（广义阶段）\n引擎会直接忽略这对 Layer 组合，可以节约 CPU 消耗"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111539-4rz3wde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111539-4rz3wde","updated":"20251009111740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总的来说，Layer Collision Matrix（碰撞层矩阵）就是一个全局碰撞过滤器"}]},{"ID":"20251009111539-06vc8al","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111539-06vc8al","updated":"20251009111844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例说明：\n假设游戏中有 Player、Monster、Bullet、UI 默认设置\nBullet 会跟 Player、Enemy、UI 层都进行碰撞检测，Player 也会跟 UI 层检测\n这样的结果就是，产生了大量的无意义的检测，\n我们可以通过设置 Layer Collision Matrix（层碰撞矩阵）大幅减少无意义计算，从而优化 CPU 性能"}]}]}